    "displayName": "Recover Cargo",
    "titleSource": "localized_clean",
    "titleConfidence": "high",
    "briefing": "Hi,\n\nSomeone knocked out one of our supply ships and towed it to [Location]. We really need the cargo onboard. You available to head over there and recover that cargo? \n\nOnce you’ve got the goods, we need them taken to their original destination at [Destination]. Did a little digging into this group, and let’s just say, they don’t come off as very professional. Shouldn’t give you too much resistance, but still best to show up ready to throw down.\n\nAlso, to make your life easier, I'd make sure you have a handheld tractor beam with you. \n\nFly Safe, \n\nLima Endicott\nLead Dispatcher\nCitizens for Prosperity",
